453
00:30:54,269 --> 00:30:56,354
Oh.

454
00:30:56,522 --> 00:30:57,980
No.

455
00:30:59,566 --> 00:31:03,861
I mean, I'm just not
at that stage where I...

456
00:31:04,029 --> 00:31:05,071
No.

457
